msgid "[clubhouse_calendar item=\"2\"] and [clubhouse_booking_form item=\"2\"] show the calendar and the booking form of another item. The item number is shown in the item list, together with ready-made shortcodes."
msgstr ""

msgid "[clubhouse_calendars] shows the calendars of all active items side by side. Use [clubhouse_calendars items=\"1,2\"] to choose which ones. For an item with several units the calendar shows how many units are free."
